cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SKiD-SLAM in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "SKiD-SLAM"
type: software
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/sparolab/SKiD-SLAM"
url: "https://sparolab.github.io/research/skid_slam/"
abstract: >-
  Distributed multi-robot LiDAR SLAM: each robot maps on its own and shares compact SOLiD
  descriptors; inter-robot loops are registered with KISS-Matcher and small_gicp, filtered with
  pairwise consistency maximization, and every map is fused into a common frame. ROS 1 (Noetic)
  and ROS 2 (Humble).
keywords:
  - SLAM
  - multi-robot
  - distributed SLAM
  - LiDAR
  - place recognition
  - planetary exploration
  - field robotics
  - ROS
